WEBVTT

00:00.950 --> 00:03.320
You want me to represent 
the current student body

00:03.320 --> 00:05.440
during the welcome ceremony 
for the new students?

00:05.860 --> 00:09.040
As a student,
it is an honor to be asked.

00:09.040 --> 00:12.040
It'll help you find 
government employment, too.

00:12.040 --> 00:16.990
Not that I imagine you care about that...

00:17.420 --> 00:20.660
But that's how it is for normal students.

00:21.110 --> 00:23.280
Yes, I'm sure.

00:27.350 --> 00:32.520
Seika, are you sure it was okay to accept?

00:32.520 --> 00:34.590
Yeah, it's fine.

00:34.590 --> 00:37.470
You'll be standing out again...

00:37.770 --> 00:42.390
This isn't standing out. It's very normal.

00:42.770 --> 00:48.220
Lately, I've been wondering if dying 
like I did in my last life

00:48.220 --> 00:51.070
made me a bit of a coward.

00:51.500 --> 00:57.720
If maybe I didn't need to find somebody 
to be the strongest in my place.

01:00.150 --> 01:04.500
I don't regret meeting them or anything.

01:05.290 --> 01:07.170
The academy's a good place.

01:07.170 --> 01:10.940
And I'm interested in my upcoming 
life as an adventurer, too.

01:12.140 --> 01:16.440
But from now on, I'm going 
to act a little more normal.

01:16.440 --> 01:21.560
Like a normal person, not someone 
who's terrified of standing out.

01:21.990 --> 01:25.780
Then, are you going to act 
like a normal person,

01:25.780 --> 01:30.980
and run from the enemy that's 
coming, instead of facing them?

01:30.980 --> 01:34.150
Oh, I'll deal with them somehow.

01:34.820 --> 01:40.070
Seika, normal people can't do that.

01:40.470 --> 01:43.760
I don't have a choice. I'm already involved.

01:43.760 --> 01:47.000
And it's easy for me.

01:47.500 --> 01:50.460
As long as they don't know who 
did it, it's not a problem.

01:51.150 --> 01:52.920
Seika...

01:53.600 --> 01:56.170
Yuki, stay close to me.

01:57.410 --> 01:59.560
We're going to get a little busy.

02:19.240 --> 02:30.330
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

03:33.390 --> 03:35.650
<i>This is just a normal city,</i>

03:36.240 --> 03:39.400
<i>with a slightly larger number of 
students studying magic than most.</i>

03:40.320 --> 03:46.000
<i>There are no monster-hunting adventurers, 
or crack Imperial troops stationed here.</i>

03:46.000 --> 03:48.080
<i>The hero is still a child.</i>

03:48.720 --> 03:51.470
<i>Nothing here is a threat to this party.</i>

03:52.500 --> 03:54.270
<i>So what is this fear?</i>

03:54.730 --> 03:56.540
<i>Is it because of the weight of my mission?</i>

03:58.500 --> 04:02.000
It's time to do what we came here for!

04:02.000 --> 04:04.890
We will now find and kill the hero.

04:05.550 --> 04:07.260
Let's go over the plan again.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.680
Right.

04:09.200 --> 04:15.000
We will drive the students towards the 
center building from all four directions,

04:15.000 --> 04:17.380
and continue our slaughter there.

04:18.450 --> 04:20.720
If you find anyone that looks 
like they might be the hero,

04:20.720 --> 04:24.660
use your dedicated magic 
items to send the signal.

04:25.110 --> 04:27.720
Even if you can't find the hero,

04:27.720 --> 04:31.330
if we cause enough chaos, 
we'll be able to lure them out.

04:31.330 --> 04:34.480
We are here today to accomplish a noble deed,

04:34.480 --> 04:36.840
for the sake of the demons, and our future!

04:37.300 --> 04:38.460
And...

04:38.970 --> 04:42.920
We will return home with all of us alive!

04:44.730 --> 04:49.350
Captain, I'm thinking this is gonna work!

04:49.350 --> 04:50.080
Yeah.

04:50.970 --> 04:53.940
Meede, Di, and the rest are all raring to go.

04:53.940 --> 04:57.240
And I know we won't lose to anybody!

04:57.240 --> 04:59.190
Right, Muderev?

04:59.190 --> 05:00.400
Indeed!

05:00.400 --> 05:02.640
That's exactly what I wanted to hear!

05:02.640 --> 05:05.170
Keep a strong heart at all times!

05:05.170 --> 05:07.930
That's what you need to do if you 
want to accomplish great things.

05:07.930 --> 05:13.120
A weak heart renders you incapable 
of doing anything, least of all war!

05:14.110 --> 05:16.540
I've heard that at least six times.

05:16.540 --> 05:19.960
You don't need to tell us. 
We've heard it many times.

05:20.200 --> 05:22.660
It's worth hearing over and over, isn't it?

05:22.660 --> 05:23.560
Quiet.

05:23.560 --> 05:24.720
Now, now.

05:25.260 --> 05:26.120
Let's go!

05:31.120 --> 05:33.340
<i>I know we can do this...</i>

05:33.970 --> 05:35.590
<i>Our party can do this!</i>

05:42.940 --> 05:43.940
Fog?

05:44.680 --> 05:47.330
There wasn't any fog outside the walls.

05:47.950 --> 05:49.910
No changing the plan now...

05:52.980 --> 05:55.340
Better than nothing, I guess.

05:57.240 --> 05:59.610
Aww, lucky. I wish I could've gone.

05:59.610 --> 06:01.750
Really? Let's go next time.

05:59.940 --> 06:01.750
Peace has addled their brains.

06:02.400 --> 06:03.840
Don't blame me for this.

06:03.840 --> 06:08.560
My brother died before 
he could fulfill his goal...

06:08.560 --> 06:11.380
but I will not!

06:16.370 --> 06:18.300
What is this?

06:22.160 --> 06:24.460
Looks like it worked.

06:24.460 --> 06:26.640
Look at this fog, though!

06:28.570 --> 06:31.600
Not that it bothers me!

06:31.600 --> 06:34.240
I've got a good sense of direction!

06:34.650 --> 06:37.680
Lately you've really been 
someone we can count on, Lo Ni.

06:37.680 --> 06:39.770
You're awake?

06:39.770 --> 06:40.480
Yeah.

06:41.180 --> 06:45.500
Where's this coming from? 
You never compliment me.

06:45.860 --> 06:49.340
I was just thinking you've gotten stronger.

06:49.810 --> 06:52.980
I have? I haven't changed a bit.

06:52.980 --> 06:55.760
It's Meede and Di that are doing the work.

06:55.760 --> 06:59.310
I'm still the weakest of us all.

06:59.620 --> 07:03.100
No, I think you're stronger than me now.

07:03.570 --> 07:06.740
You've gotten better at using your monsters.

07:06.740 --> 07:08.440
And your heart, too...

07:09.600 --> 07:10.570
Really?

07:10.570 --> 07:13.680
I was the best tamer in my village.

07:13.680 --> 07:16.450
So I thought nobody could ever beat me!

07:16.450 --> 07:19.050
But then I met the captain and Muderev,

07:19.050 --> 07:21.520
I went on a journey, 
and so many things happened...

07:21.520 --> 07:24.730
I feel like I've been taught 
how weak I really am.

07:24.730 --> 07:29.450
I have a little more confidence now, too.

07:29.450 --> 07:30.590
You do?

07:30.590 --> 07:33.550
You were the strongest in 
your village, too, right?

07:33.550 --> 07:38.220
This power is useless in times of peace.

07:38.800 --> 07:41.910
Because of it, I sleep constantly.

07:42.890 --> 07:46.400
I caused lots of problems for everybody.

07:48.080 --> 07:52.890
But today... I feel like I can 
finally hold my head high.

07:52.890 --> 07:59.100
I can't wait to tell Mom and 
Dad that I defeated the hero.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.660
Yeah.

08:02.080 --> 08:04.790
We need to hurry up and 
get this over with, then.

08:11.270 --> 08:12.550
Go!

08:19.430 --> 08:21.560
What? Come back!

08:29.980 --> 08:31.170
What's this?

08:34.680 --> 08:36.960
I don't see anyone.

08:36.960 --> 08:40.060
Is this a place no one goes to?

08:40.720 --> 08:43.340
I can't cause a ruckus here.

08:46.400 --> 08:48.700
My sturdy club has been damaged!

08:48.700 --> 08:51.880
Strong one, tell me your name!

08:57.120 --> 08:59.220
What are you?

08:59.220 --> 09:02.170
I am Muderev the ogre!

09:02.660 --> 09:05.350
The one who will defeat you!

09:05.350 --> 09:07.040
Where were you hired?

09:07.040 --> 09:10.010
There was nobody like you in 
the Merchants Association.

09:10.010 --> 09:11.280
Merchants Association?

09:12.640 --> 09:15.030
I have no idea what you're talking about.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.400
It doesn't matter.

09:16.400 --> 09:18.740
I won't let you take another step.

09:34.520 --> 09:36.430
You're staying on the defensive, are you?

09:39.640 --> 09:41.320
<i>That skill...</i>

09:41.320 --> 09:42.240
<i>Impossible!</i>

09:42.240 --> 09:46.890
<i>Her strike is so heavy... but she's so agile!</i>

09:47.160 --> 09:49.770
<i>A worthy opponent!</i>

09:51.470 --> 09:52.650
<i>It's light!</i>

09:58.340 --> 10:00.320
You fool! It'll take more than that...

10:00.960 --> 10:02.660
You're the fool.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.860
Even I can use this much magic.

10:07.860 --> 10:09.290
Stay put.

10:09.700 --> 10:11.960
No, I'm sorry, but...

10:15.490 --> 10:21.710
Zormnem tells me I've got 
resistance to all magic elements!

10:24.980 --> 10:28.100
Fight me with power, not tricks!

10:45.720 --> 10:47.380
How strange...

10:55.870 --> 11:00.580
Zor, this isn't the rendezvous point, right?

11:01.100 --> 11:04.290
For some reason, I found myself coming here...

11:04.770 --> 11:07.050
Yes. So did I.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.750
Zormnem? Gull Ganis?

11:11.750 --> 11:12.520
Is that you?

11:13.840 --> 11:15.550
Huh? Guys?

11:15.550 --> 11:16.860
What are you doing here?

11:17.580 --> 11:18.820
You, too?

11:19.510 --> 11:23.740
Yes... but the humans are kind of strange.

11:23.740 --> 11:25.210
For you, too, then?

11:25.210 --> 11:26.560
It was the same for me.

11:27.040 --> 11:30.290
I tried to slay them but felt nothing 
as the blade passed through.

11:30.780 --> 11:33.990
Instead, I found these strange 
talismans on the ground.

11:33.990 --> 11:35.960
Is it some kind of magic?

11:35.960 --> 11:38.380
Oh, we saw them, too?

11:38.890 --> 11:40.550
As did I!

11:41.020 --> 11:42.470
Me, too!

11:45.170 --> 11:48.390
Captain, something weird's going on here...

11:49.190 --> 11:51.300
<i>Something's very wrong...</i>

11:51.300 --> 11:53.830
<i>We can't continue the mission.</i>

11:53.830 --> 11:54.560
Retreat...

11:54.950 --> 12:01.050
Kokoro se yo, kawatare ni komu warabe no

12:01.490 --> 12:05.980
kiba mo arawa ni hi wo matowamu wo

12:09.390 --> 12:15.130
This was a poem by a certain 
swordsman who battled ayakashi.

12:15.540 --> 12:18.560
"Be wary of visitors who come at dusk.

12:18.560 --> 12:24.800
What looks like a child may suddenly bare 
fangs and wreathe itself in unholy fire."

12:24.800 --> 12:26.550
That's what it means.

12:27.000 --> 12:29.970
You didn't realize, did you...

12:29.970 --> 12:33.870
that every person here 
is one of my shikigami...

12:36.480 --> 12:41.790
Oh, but you, big guy... 
The girl you fought was real.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.650
She's strong, isn't she?

12:43.930 --> 12:48.940
Hmm... I can tell you are strong!

12:49.550 --> 12:52.120
And far stronger than most!

12:52.650 --> 12:55.520
I could not ask for a better opponent!

12:55.520 --> 12:56.790
I challenge you—

13:00.880 --> 13:02.960
Oops. He's dead.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.510
I didn't realize his resistance 
to my curses was so low.

13:07.150 --> 13:09.990
I once battled a bandit leader who ran at me

13:09.990 --> 13:14.070
even after being hit with this spell, 
blood dripping from his neck.

13:14.940 --> 13:17.810
Guess he should've trained harder.

13:19.400 --> 13:20.770
Pyrslaria!

13:21.540 --> 13:22.940
Don't...

13:23.430 --> 13:24.540
Die.

13:29.270 --> 13:30.650
An evil eye, huh?

13:30.650 --> 13:33.040
You're a tria, aren't you?

13:33.040 --> 13:35.700
Your evil eye is more powerful 
than that of a human's.

13:35.700 --> 13:39.290
But I'm afraid you won't be 
able to turn me to stone.

13:40.210 --> 13:42.590
Here, have a shot against mine.

13:43.300 --> 13:44.350
Summoning.

13:46.050 --> 13:47.270
White Snake.

14:09.580 --> 14:10.780
Pyrslaria!

14:10.780 --> 14:15.970
How did you like that? An evil gaze 
powerful enough to stop your heart...

14:17.320 --> 14:19.970
But that snake's eyes...

14:20.420 --> 14:24.060
Some snakes have a third eye.

14:24.610 --> 14:28.590
This is the White Snake, an ayakashi 
that was originally an aged viper.

14:28.590 --> 14:30.340
It used infrared rays near its nose to...

14:41.720 --> 14:44.150
Be my friend!

14:47.100 --> 14:52.700
I've always been able to become friends 
with anybody, just by talking to them!

14:52.700 --> 14:56.160
No! Run, Lo Ni!

15:01.920 --> 15:03.520
What was the point of that?

15:03.520 --> 15:06.380
Oh, was he trying to tame it?

15:07.830 --> 15:11.600
That's not going to work on an 
ayakashi born of human hate...

15:13.870 --> 15:16.220
<i>Nothing about him is normal...</i>

15:17.130 --> 15:23.230
<i>I knew from the start that challenging 
that monster was a mistake!</i>

15:24.150 --> 15:31.410
<i>I was wrong to think this party 
had any chance of defeating him!</i>

15:32.380 --> 15:36.230
Zor! I'll distract him!

15:36.230 --> 15:37.410
You can...

15:37.840 --> 15:39.170
No!

15:39.170 --> 15:40.720
You run!

15:40.720 --> 15:41.920
<i>Run</i>!

15:43.740 --> 15:45.420
You must survive!

15:45.810 --> 15:49.340
Survive and tell our fellows!

15:50.050 --> 15:51.910
You saw, didn't you?

15:51.910 --> 15:54.010
Who is he?

15:54.770 --> 15:55.780
That's...

15:56.180 --> 16:00.480
<b>Seika Lamprogue</b>

15:58.870 --> 16:00.480
The demon king!

16:01.520 --> 16:03.160
Wh-What are you saying?

16:03.160 --> 16:06.520
Go back and tell them! No matter what!

16:06.520 --> 16:11.000
I know you came to kill the hero.

16:11.000 --> 16:14.450
But I'm sorry, you won't 
be able to kill Amyu.

16:15.260 --> 16:17.500
She's got me protecting her.

16:20.070 --> 16:22.020
He was born...

16:22.650 --> 16:24.750
in the worst possible way.

16:24.750 --> 16:27.230
The most terrible demon king...

16:24.830 --> 16:29.280
<b>Episode 12:
The Most Terrible Demon King</b>

16:27.230 --> 16:29.280
has joined the side of the humans!

16:29.280 --> 16:32.420
You guys done?

16:32.670 --> 16:35.430
Go! I'll buy time!

16:35.430 --> 16:38.050
No, Zor! You come, too!

16:38.050 --> 16:39.690
We won't both be able to escape.

16:39.690 --> 16:43.810
But with your teleportation magic, 
perhaps you can get out of here alone!

16:44.110 --> 16:47.730
Don't let everyone's sacrifice be in vain!

16:49.120 --> 16:51.910
You guys ready to die, then?

16:53.900 --> 16:55.910
Hurry, Ganis!

17:15.650 --> 17:17.340
One got away, I guess.

17:23.480 --> 17:26.020
Damn it... Damn it all!

17:27.210 --> 17:29.680
That's the demon king?

17:30.870 --> 17:34.710
That's... That's impossible!

17:50.750 --> 17:54.060
What is this?

17:54.990 --> 17:57.230
Did he do this?

17:58.400 --> 18:04.020
Who is that demon king?

18:09.330 --> 18:12.820
Well, not that it matters if he got away.

18:15.800 --> 18:18.990
I'm terrified, Seika...

18:18.990 --> 18:25.620
You don't even need a catalyst 
for your curses, do you?

18:25.620 --> 18:28.160
You were able to use a simple 
talisman to do that...

18:28.650 --> 18:34.580
I do. Without some hair or blood, 
there's a bunch of limits on the spell.

18:35.120 --> 18:36.090
And...

18:36.680 --> 18:38.430
I was feeling a little lazy.

18:40.850 --> 18:41.850
Mabel.

18:42.230 --> 18:43.950
Seika, where is he?

18:43.950 --> 18:44.750
"He"?

18:44.750 --> 18:46.430
An assassin from the Merchants Association!

18:46.850 --> 18:49.130
He must still be looking for me!

18:49.130 --> 18:52.750
And if he can't find me, 
he might hurt someone else!

18:53.240 --> 18:54.820
I have to stop him!

18:54.820 --> 18:57.620
You were the one who saved 
me back there, right?

18:57.620 --> 18:59.850
If you know where he is, tell me!

18:59.850 --> 19:01.360
Everyone's in danger!

19:01.840 --> 19:06.540
<i>A spell to keep people away won't work 
if that person has a strong goal in mind.</i>

19:06.800 --> 19:11.840
<i>She's been on guard for assassins from the 
association this whole time, hasn't she?</i>

19:13.020 --> 19:15.240
Mabel, calm down.

19:15.740 --> 19:19.080
Were you worried about the 
other students before yourself?

19:19.080 --> 19:21.040
Not many people can be like that.

19:21.040 --> 19:23.910
It takes kindness and courage.

19:23.910 --> 19:25.600
Forget that! He's still out there!

19:25.890 --> 19:30.020
He wasn't after you. He was after the hero.

19:30.020 --> 19:31.440
Amyu?

19:31.440 --> 19:34.060
Then we have to do something!

19:34.060 --> 19:37.510
It's dealt with, so don't worry.

19:38.700 --> 19:40.990
Did you defeat him, Seika?

19:41.840 --> 19:44.800
Don't tell the others, Mabel.

19:52.000 --> 19:54.080
You that scared of a little speech?

19:54.790 --> 19:56.670
I'm not scared.

19:57.570 --> 20:00.420
I'd be really nervous!

20:00.700 --> 20:02.590
How was it for you?

20:02.590 --> 20:05.660
You mean when I did my speech 
for the incoming class?

20:05.660 --> 20:08.060
I wasn't nervous at all.

20:08.560 --> 20:14.350
I was a little bit of a bad girl back then, 
so I was like, "This whole speech thing is stupid!"

20:14.350 --> 20:16.810
I think if I did it now, I'd be nervous.

20:18.590 --> 20:22.700
The demons interrupted my speech, though.

20:23.140 --> 20:24.910
What were you going to say?

20:24.910 --> 20:30.290
Um, "I only came to this 
school to get stronger."

20:30.560 --> 20:33.760
"The strength I seek is the 
strength of an adventurer."

20:33.760 --> 20:37.260
"The strength to defeat monsters 
and protect my friends."

20:37.260 --> 20:39.810
"Everyone here wants a 
different kind of strength."

20:40.300 --> 20:46.470
"But if you seek strength, we are 
comrades who share the same goal."

20:46.470 --> 20:48.340
"Let's all do our best together!"

20:48.970 --> 20:50.890
Something like that?

20:51.220 --> 20:52.810
That's a good speech.

20:53.170 --> 20:56.160
I wish I could've heard it 
at the entrance ceremony.

20:56.160 --> 20:59.400
Really? Thanks, Yifa.

20:57.510 --> 21:03.570
<i>She has no idea that those 
demons were after her.</i>

21:04.040 --> 21:08.430
<i>Or that the same thing 
happened just the other day.</i>

21:08.430 --> 21:10.740
I'll be going, then.

21:10.740 --> 21:12.850
Good luck, Seika.

21:12.850 --> 21:14.270
Good luck.

21:14.270 --> 21:17.220
I can't wait to see what you say.

21:17.220 --> 21:19.450
It won't be anything that special.

21:19.950 --> 21:21.580
I'm just going to get it over with.

21:23.200 --> 21:24.170
No one move!

21:24.730 --> 21:26.680
We are the Dirac Knights!

21:26.680 --> 21:29.900
I am here at the order of 
my master, Marquis Grevil.

21:29.900 --> 21:32.360
Is the girl named Amyu here?

21:32.360 --> 21:35.290
Um, I'm Amyu.

21:37.090 --> 21:37.900
Out of the way.

21:38.240 --> 21:41.320
You are Amyu, daughter of 
the adventurer Clauden, yes?

21:41.320 --> 21:43.740
Yes. What do want with me?

21:44.050 --> 21:46.900
You have committed crimes against the empire.

21:46.900 --> 21:52.270
You committed a grave crime 
by slaying a demon emissary

21:52.270 --> 21:56.120
who visited the academy the other day.

21:56.120 --> 21:58.330
You admit this, don't you?

21:58.330 --> 22:00.920
Huh? What are you talking about?

22:00.920 --> 22:03.090
Arrest her!
